## Summary

Make the PR-Steward, Bridge, and gate engine importable and expose a single dopemux pr-steward console command (subcommands intake, bridge, gate, audit, doctor) with a stable, versioned CLI contract. The safety-critical steward_gate logic ships in the package (pip), never in scaffolded YAML.

## Scope

Allowlist-bound; see commit.allowlist. Out of scope: Do not change engine semantics. Do not scaffold into init templates (that is TP-302). Do not add console scripts beyond dopemux pr-steward.

## Validation

See commit.verify; embedded audit + proof bundle required.

